  {
   "id": "adr-context-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 273,
   "width": 1392,
   "height": 80.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1840228675,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 530666991,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bruckner et al. reviewed CTIS as exported on 2025-11-10 (7,547 Phase II\u2013IV trials, now seeded in ctis.search_export_snapshot). Of 234 trials legally required to report: 116 reported fully on time, 20\nlate, 98 not fully reported. Of the 234, 140 had a complete results document, 47 an incomplete one, 47 none. Two people checked each of 206 results documents (participants reported, outcomes\nreported, cancelled); they first agreed on 163 and resolved the rest. Their \"extended deadline\" flags came from non-public CTIS data. A wrong \"not fully reported\" accuses a named sponsor in public. An\nLLM's own confidence number is not calibrated out of the box.",
   "originalText": "Bruckner et al. reviewed CTIS as exported on 2025-11-10 (7,547 Phase II\u2013IV trials, now seeded in ctis.search_export_snapshot). Of 234 trials legally required to report: 116 reported fully on time, 20 late, 98 not fully reported. Of the 234, 140 had a complete results document, 47 an incomplete one, 47 none. Two people checked each of 206 results documents (participants reported, outcomes reported, cancelled); they first agreed on 163 and resolved the rest. Their \"extended deadline\" flags came from non-public CTIS data. A wrong \"not fully reported\" accuses a named sponsor in public. An LLM's own confidence number is not calibrated out of the box.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-context",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
