   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Results documents must be fetched as they were when the reviewers read them. With 47\nincomplete documents, Bruckner's data alone can't prove the 99% line. Confidence must be\nre-checked whenever the model or prompt changes.",
   "originalText": "Results documents must be fetched as they were when the reviewers read them. With 47 incomplete documents, Bruckner's data alone can't prove the 99% line. Confidence must be re-checked whenever the model or prompt changes.",
