   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Done: their export, PIP list, final verdicts and per-part reviews loaded (ctis seed, gold\nbruckner, gold bruckner-reviews); our due-date rules reproduce all 277 verdicts (gold\ncompare-due). Accepted 2026-11-01. The per-part comparison and setting the 99% line on real\nconfidence scores move to S8's lab, once the results-document check exists.",
   "originalText": "Done: their export, PIP list, final verdicts and per-part reviews loaded (ctis seed, gold\nbruckner, gold bruckner-reviews); our due-date rules reproduce all 277 verdicts (gold\ncompare-due). Accepted 2026-11-01. The per-part comparison and setting the 99% line on real\nconfidence scores move to S8's lab, once the results-document check exists.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-lab",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
